The SNP at position Chr09:6324094, was associated with variations in Mg and is located in the 3’ region of Potri.009G061100, a MATE efflux family protein found to be co-expressed with genes related to ‘ion transport’, ‘cation transport’, and biotic stress response (
Supplementary Table S5
). The
Arabidopsis
