Gaxiola et al., 2001
;
Yang et al., 2007
,
2015
). Interestingly, to date, none of these gene families have been directly related to the response to heavy metals.
In addition, Potri.004G151700, homologous to the broad substrate-specificity H
+
-symporter AtPMT5 in
